# The repo's canonical text form is LF, in the working tree and in the blob alike. The sources
# carry Chinese prose and the five `*.ps1` carry a UTF-8 BOM that Windows PowerShell 5.1 needs:
# read without one, Chinese text comes back as GBK. `*.cmd` is the one exception, because cmd.exe
# wants CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf